    "ScenarioProfile": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One discrete what-if corner: the two knobs turned, and the ledger priced on them.\n\nThe typed peer of the frontend's former hardcoded ``CRA_PROFILES`` array. Every dollar\nfigure is computed here from the committed instrument (the CRA extraction) and the\ncommitted, cited local parameters — so the profile the site renders and the profile the\nessay tabulates are the same object, and neither can drift from the record.",
      "properties": {
        "key": {
          "title": "Key",
