  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "The economic argument as disciplined scenario bands (#1665, epic #1659 ME-F).\n\nAssembled by :func:`watermark.economics.scenarios.derive_economic_scenarios` from three\ncommitted inputs — the site's abatement instrument (the CRA extraction), its cited local\ntax parameters + what-if knobs (``abatement_parameters_relpath``), and the network-global\nindustry priors (``reference/datacenter-industry/priors.yaml``) — plus the facility power\nbasis where one exists. Nothing is re-keyed: every figure traces to one of those files.\n\nInstrument-gated: a site with no abatement agreement on the record produces ``None``, so\nno peer is ever priced off another county's mills.",
  "properties": {
    "site": {
      "title": "Site",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "site_name": {
      "title": "Site Name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "instrument": {
      "title": "Instrument",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "instrument_record": {
      "title": "Instrument Record",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "tag": {
      "const": "open",
      "default": "open",
      "title": "Tag",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "confidence": {
      "const": "low",
      "default": "low",
      "title": "Confidence",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "constants": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ScenarioConstant"
      },
      "title": "Constants",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "withheld": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/WithheldInput"
      },
      "title": "Withheld",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "axes": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ScenarioAxis"
      },
      "title": "Axes",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "profiles": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ScenarioProfile"
      },
      "title": "Profiles",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "lines": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ScenarioLine"
      },
      "title": "Lines",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "load_per_job": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ScenarioLine"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "method": {
      "default": "",
      "title": "Method",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "disclaimer": {
      "default": "A labeled counterfactual, not a finding. Every figure here is a band across explicitly stated scenarios whose constants are all on the table — it prices what the public instrument WOULD cost under each set of assumptions, and asserts nothing about which one is true. The GovCloud / defense-hardened profile in particular is a what-if on two knobs (building share and headcount); it is NOT a claim that this facility does defense work. That question is open and the corpus does not answer it (docs/defense-nexus.md).",
      "title": "Disclaimer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "caveats": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Caveats",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
